&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are (&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.modemobile.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Mode.Inc&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mode is a fast-growing technology company building businesses at the intersection of AI, data, mobile apps, and digital experiences. Our portfolio of mobile apps and digital products reaches 100M+ monthly active users across a global audience. We continue to accelerate growth through product innovation, strategic acquisitions, and emerging business opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mode was recognized by Deloitte as the &lt;strong&gt;#1 fastest-growing software company in North America&lt;/strong&gt; on the 2023 Technology Fast 500. Today, we are building our next phase of growth, including expanding Mode&#39;s AI and data business and developing direct relationships with companies that can benefit from the data and capabilities we have built.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Team and Culture Drive Our Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Our team is the heart of our culture.&amp;nbsp; We value innovation, collaboration, and curiosity, with a passion for getting things done.&amp;nbsp; We strive to hire and cultivate the best team members and foster a culture of open communication and transparency.&amp;nbsp; We are driven and hard-working but also committed to having fun along the way.&amp;nbsp; We allow OKRs to guide us, assume positive intent, sometimes agree to disagree and commit, honor our commitments, seek to accomplish more with less, and encourage everyone to speak up as our team owns our company’s success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You can read more about our team and how we work &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.modemobile.com/team&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring an &lt;strong&gt;Ad Monetization Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to optimize monetization and revenue yield across our growing portfolio of mobile apps, with a primary focus on ad monetization. This is a highly strategic and analytical role, working cross-functionally with product, data and analytics, growth, and advertising partners to ensure Mode is maximizing revenue across our inventory, offers, and audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Ad Monetization Manager will own and grow our ad monetization surfaces, managing ad providers and demand sources, managing pricing floors, analyzing performance, and driving data-informed decisions that grow total and per-user revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact, high-autonomy, fully remote role with significant visibility and upside, ideal for someone with strong adtech experience, an AI-native way of working, and a bias for driving measurable results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and own Mode&#39;s monetization and yield strategy including waterfall management, mediation setup, ad placement configuration across the portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and optimize in-app ad placements, formats and user segmentation strategies to improve ARPDAU, eCPM, fill rate and overall LTV.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain relationships with ad network partners and account managers to maximise performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Story&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn’t a “build it from scratch” play. The rocket’s already off the pad. We’re talking about NGL, a viral Gen-Z social platform with 100+ million monthly active users, a raw, unfiltered space where people can be real, curious, and connected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recently joined Mode’s rocket-fuel portfolio, this app is already a cultural phenomenon; now it’s time to turn momentum into mastery. The business already generates mid-eight-figure annual revenue, with headroom to grow profitability through subscriptions, ads, global expansion, and new formats. It’s the next evolution of anonymous, authentic connection.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a General Manager who sees the matrix, a product-obsessed builder who can scale something massive without killing its magic. Someone who instinctively understands why people share secrets online, why virality strikes at 2 a.m., and how to turn that energy into a thriving business. You know how to translate engagement into sustainable revenue growth through ad innovation, conversion optimization, and scalable monetization models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Take what’s already winning and make it legendary. Lead this app like it’s your own company, owning strategy, product, growth, and revenue end-to-end. You’ll have full license to move fast, experiment hard, and make the decisions that shape culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This Role’s for Someone Who&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thinks like a founder, moves like an operator, and executes like a hacker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives on feedback loops over hierarchies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knows how to turn chaos into compounding growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll report directly to the CEO, leading a cross-functional crew that’s half startup, half strike team, and scaling one of the most viral platforms into its next phase of dominance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the universe. P&amp;amp;L, team, and strategy, it’s yours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn good into unstoppable. Take a thriving app and evolve it into a long-term cultural force.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monetize creatively. Build smarter ad ecosystems, better subscription experiences, and new revenue plays we haven’t dreamed up yet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify high-ROI monetization opportunities that increase LTV without compromising user experience and retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ship constantly. Hypothesize → test → ship → learn → repeat.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay dangerously curious. Watch what Gen-Z does next and build ahead of it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow the tribe. Recruit top talent, build the culture, protect the weirdness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale with soul. Keep the app’s authenticity intact as we expand globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the bridge. Connect your scrappy team with Mode’s shared growth, data, and product firepower.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years running product, growth, or GM roles at viral consumer apps, and social, creator, or messaging DNA required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven record of scaling and evolving, not just chasing downloads, but building real engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience driving monetization strategy, especially across ad-based and subscription-driven models, with measurable impact on revenue and profit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep empathy for online communities and the messy beauty of human behavior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong instincts backed by data fluency, you love retention curves, funnel drop-offs, and aha-moments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort in ambiguity. Grit under pressure. Confidence without ego.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;

