&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a mid-senior UA Creative Strategist to help scale creative production for a fast-growing portfolio of consumer apps spanning rewarded/earn, utility, and viral/social categories. You&#39;ll partner closely with our Ad Creative Lead, on creative vision and brand, and with our UA Managers, to translate performance data and growth priorities into concepts, briefs, and scripts. You&#39;ll own creative strategy for a dedicated vertical of the portfolio (Rewarded / Earn Apps), working alongside our other Strategists/Designers, and distill your concepts into briefs that a production team of in-house producers and contractors can execute at scale. This is a mid-senior individual contributor role reporting to the Director of UA &amp;amp; Growth, with day-to-day creative direction from our Ad Creative Lead.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are and What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own creative strategy for a dedicated app vertical (Rewarded / Earn Apps), developing concepts, briefs, and scripts that translate performance data and growth priorities into testable creative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our Ad Creative Lead on overall creative vision, brand consistency, and team brainstorms, while driving vertical-specific execution&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write briefs and scripts that scale — targeting 15-20 net-new concepts per week with 4-5 variations each, handed off to our producer/editor team and contractor network for execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are (&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.modemobile.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Mode.Inc&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mode is a fast-growing technology company building businesses at the intersection of AI, data, mobile apps, and digital experiences. Our portfolio of mobile apps and digital products reaches 100M+ monthly active users across a global audience. We continue to accelerate growth through product innovation, strategic acquisitions, and emerging business opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
