&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You can read more about our team and how we work &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.modemobile.com/team&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an outgoing Customer Service Associate to assist our customers with product/app/offers related inquiries in a swift, proficient, and friendly manner. The Customer Service Associate will be instrumental in customer retention by addressing their concerns and issues via email, chat, and social media, with a professional, positive approach. To ensure success in this position you will have the ability to maintain a sound knowledge of the product, app, and offers and be an effective communicator.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position will support our Customer Success team&#39;s efforts to expand customer support coverage, including weekends&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Candidates should be available to work a consistent five-day schedule that includes weekend shifts, either Tuesday through Saturday &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;or&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Friday through Tuesday.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are and What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide highest-level, personalized support to customers, responding to and resolving issues promptly and appropriately&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attend training sessions to grow and maintain knowledge of products, services, offers, policies, and to develop customer service skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify customer needs, help customers find solutions to their unique scenarios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve email, chat, and social media customer inquiries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forward and escalate inquiries to relevant individuals and departments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update customer information as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;

&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Opportunity | No Cap on Qualified Referrals | No Exclusivity Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR NETWORK COULD BE WORTH $50K+.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Know a U.S. company with 20+ full-time employees and at least three years of operating history that could be a strong customer for Mode? Make the introduction. If Mode closes the deal with the customer, you can earn &lt;strong&gt;$50,000 or a 6% customer sign-up bonus - whichever is greater.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There is no cap on the number of companies you can refer. You do not need to leave your current role, commit to working for Mode, or take on a full-time position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mode is expanding its relationships across the AI and data ecosystem. We are looking for exceptional networkers, relationship builders, and business development professionals who can open doors to U.S.-based companies and help us accelerate new customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT MODE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mode is a fast-growing technology company building businesses at the intersection of AI, data, mobile apps, and digital experiences. Our portfolio of mobile apps and digital products reaches 100M+ monthly active users across a global audience. We continue to accelerate growth through product innovation, strategic acquisitions, and emerging business opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mode was recognized by Deloitte as the &lt;strong&gt;#1 fastest-growing software company in North America&lt;/strong&gt; on the 2023 Technology Fast 500. Today, we are building our next phase of growth, including expanding Mode&#39;s AI and data business and developing direct relationships with companies that can benefit from the data and capabilities we have built.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are ambitious about where we are headed, with a targeted IPO in Q1 2028. This referral opportunity is one way to participate in that growth, whether you simply make valuable introductions or ultimately build a deeper relationship with Mode.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How It Works&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; JOIN. &lt;/strong&gt;Sign up for Mode&#39;s affiliate program at &lt;a href=&quot;http://bizbuydata.com/50k&quot;&gt;bizbuydata.com/50k&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; REFER. &lt;/strong&gt;Introduce us to one or more U.S.-based companies with the following criteria:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;U.S.-based companies with at least 20 employees and a minimum of three years of operating experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accounting, Law firms, IT, sales, and other businesses with a high volume of desk work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The more years of operating history and desk office employees, the stronger the fit.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll provide your customer referral information during the Affiliate Program sign-up process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; WE EVALUATE &amp;amp; CLOSE. &lt;/strong&gt;Mode reviews the opportunity and, if there is a fit, takes it from there.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; YOU EARN. &lt;/strong&gt;If Mode closes your qualifying referral, you receive $50,000 or 6% customer sign-up bonus, whichever is greater. Payment will be made within 30 days of Mode receiving payment from the applicable customer.&amp;nbsp; subject to the terms of the affiliate program. The 6% bonus will be calculated on net revenue received by Mode from the customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;One referral. $50K+. Multiple successful referrals? Multiple earning opportunities. There is no cap.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Might Be Perfect for This If...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You know people, and the right people know you.&lt;/p&gt;
